{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownbreakers</strong> is a fast-paced card game of revolutionary violence. This <i>spiritpunk</i> world is ruled by tyrants that grow fat by stealing souls just to grind them into profit. Fight against necromantic criminals and demonic billionaires.\u00a0Break the\u00a0soul trade and free your city. Crownbreakers combines turn-based tactics with deck-building mechanics in one snappy package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/490f0bd066cf0b9926d93918df6e3a0d.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/490f0bd066cf0b9926d93918df6e3a0d.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your champion's actions and your cards together to control the battlefield. Push enemies into the perfect position for your area of effect abilities or chain explosive barrels together to pulverize the opposition. Master this to make the most of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/071dff2bd411043c4adbcba821bd0856.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=615 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/071dff2bd411043c4adbcba821bd0856.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/405736ba686e795e42e1e67431f2c5f8.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/405736ba686e795e42e1e67431f2c5f8.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn the battlefield advances, uncovering new obstacles, new enemies but also new rewards: rare cards for your deck, powerful relics to enable new synergies, and stickers to add to your cards. Build your deck and keep pushing forward. Only the strong can make it to the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/9adb38fce2403d6344cd9cc0f1f31951.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=615 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/9adb38fce2403d6344cd9cc0f1f31951.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/ae28624f09d82f6be5fba078968264bf.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/ae28624f09d82f6be5fba078968264bf.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Stickers to create powerful, custom cards. With stickers you can increase a card's damage, add new abilities or even extend a card's area of effect. Limits are for other people. And the right sticker on the right card can make or break a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/bfca3cd433ac7c6aa1a29d15d6e56289.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=615 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/bfca3cd433ac7c6aa1a29d15d6e56289.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/6bc053ab7ecaf4781a5971336027c09a.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/6bc053ab7ecaf4781a5971336027c09a.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/6bc053ab7ecaf4781a5971336027c09a.mp4?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests and return with loot from your battles. Share you resources with the people of the city and get to know its colorful characters. Before your return for another run against the city's tyrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/b8a2ae4936d9057ba629b0bce56f5320.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/b8a2ae4936d9057ba629b0bce56f5320.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/b8a2ae4936d9057ba629b0bce56f5320.mp4?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD OF MAGIC AND OFFICE JOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where modern technology and magic coexist. People commute to work and buy their drinks at the franchise coffee shop on the corner while spirits bring technology alive and floating islands drift on invisible currents across the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truly dedicated can strengthen their soul and learn ways of using this magic to master mighty supernatural abilities. Unfortunately the rich and powerful know how to buy, steal or crush both magic and souls. All so they can hyper-charge their stranglehold on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're not playing their game. You are ready to fight against their oppression. And you will break their crowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/cbdaa569f3d0af6932030d24863502c7.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=1000 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownbreakers</strong> is being developed by the team that brought you the flavorful deck-building game Nowhere Prophet. We're currently deep in the development. There's still a lot of work to do. Which means all the artwork and screenshots on this page may not necessarily reflect the quality of the final product.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development was made possible by the following partners:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/817cb8ca2ee59e06c32131d0d793bf97.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=89 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2938540?t=1773070171","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2938540?t=1773070171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/c4c58f2e1e10a94f5e06092a64b3a16b550c7d8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773070171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/c4c58f2e1e10a94f5e06092a64b3a16b550c7d8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773070171","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4338150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownbreakers</strong> is a fast-paced card game of revolutionary violence. This <i>spiritpunk</i> world is ruled by tyrants that grow fat by stealing souls just to grind them into profit. Fight against necromantic criminals and demonic billionaires.\u00a0Break the\u00a0soul trade and free your city. Crownbreakers combines turn-based tactics with deck-building mechanics in one snappy package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared