span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/6bc053ab7ecaf4781a5971336027c09a.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/6bc053ab7ecaf4781a5971336027c09a.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/6bc053ab7ecaf4781a5971336027c09a.mp4?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests and return with loot from your battles. Share you resources with the people of the city and get to know its colorful characters. Before your return for another run against the city's tyrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/b8a2ae4936d9057ba629b0bce56f5320.poster.avif?t=1773070171\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/b8a2ae4936d9057ba629b0bce56f5320.webm?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/b8a2ae4936d9057ba629b0bce56f5320.mp4?t=1773070171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD OF MAGIC AND OFFICE JOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where modern technology and magic coexist. People commute to work and buy their drinks at the franchise coffee shop on the corner while spirits bring technology alive and floating islands drift on invisible currents across the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truly dedicated can strengthen their soul and learn ways of using this magic to master mighty supernatural abilities. Unfortunately the rich and powerful know how to buy, steal or crush both magic and souls. All so they can hyper-charge their stranglehold on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're not playing their game. You are ready to fight against their oppression. And you will break their crowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/cbdaa569f3d0af6932030d24863502c7.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=1000 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownbreakers</strong> is being developed by the team that brought you the flavorful deck-building game Nowhere Prophet. We're currently deep in the development. There's still a lot of work to do. Which means all the artwork and screenshots on this page may not necessarily reflect the quality of the final product.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development was made possible by the following partners:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/extras/817cb8ca2ee59e06c32131d0d793bf97.avif?t=1773070171\" width=630 height=89 /></span></p>","developers":["Sharkbomb Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/1c06dfedf30b0ca09e91bd46398ebadabb118bf1/header.jpg?t=1773070171","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2938540/172076137/a33c40b1c4a69b9a7e5d62cc27a88b05a78db1b9/1750890568/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749480614","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2938540/172076137/a33c40b1c4a69b9a7e5d62cc27a88b05a78db1b9/1750890568/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749480614","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2938540/172076137/a33c40b1c4a69b9a7e5d62cc27a88b05a78db1b9/1750890568/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749480614","id":257143342,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143342/004268c5e728eafe10e4951b790cd38dac7fe6e5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749480614"}],"name":"Crownbreakers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sharkbomb Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00c3\u00b3pria\nAtos criminosos\nViol\u00c3\u00aancia fantasiosa","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nDerbe Sprache\nFantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/eb3b30175d3200e21458ea3dd504188df3deb4d1/ss_eb3b30175d3200e21458ea3dd504188df3deb4d1.1920x108