429cdfe042617dc9a/ss_740cd71a8be7c8e24844a40429cdfe042617dc9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773070171","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938540/740cd71a8be7c8e24844a40429cdfe042617dc9a/ss_740cd71a8be7c8e24844a40429cdfe042617dc9a.600x338.jpg?t=1773070171"}],"short_description":"Tyrants keep the magical city of Cascade in a chokehold. They grow fat by grinding everyone else's soul into profit. \u270aENOUGH! Crash into their districts and build your deck as you push forward. Use your champions and cards to pummel some demonic billionaires in this turn-based card-game brawler.","steam_appid":2938540,"support_info":{"email":"contact@sharkbombs.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"http://www.crownbreakersgame.com"}